# Adaptive UI

Read `docs/system/adaptive-ui.md` before adding or changing a screen layout.

- Every screen targets phones, tablets, and foldables. Desktop large windows follow the same Compose layouts.
- Layout adapts in the view. The ViewModel or Swift model does not branch on form factor.
- Do not assume a portrait phone. Bound content width on large screens; do not stretch a phone column edge to edge.
- Respect safe areas and insets on every size. Do not ship a phone-only layout.
